### Logout
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "RefreshToken": {{refresh}}
}
### Refresh The access and Refresh Tokens
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "RefreshToken": {{refresh}}
}